<title>UK: Marks&amp;Spencer year profits top 1.0 billion s.</title>
<headline>Marks&amp;Spencer year profits top 1.0 billion s.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  26.7		 vs 23.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    9.7		 vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   13.0		 vs 11.4</p>
<p> Pretax		    1,102.0		 vs 965.8</p>
<p> Turnover		  7,841.9		 vs 7,211.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 1,100.0 and 1,130.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Marks and Spencer Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
